WEBVTT

00:00:04.507 --> 00:00:07.147
Mmm, I know you're a princess
and I'm just a stable boy.

00:00:07.227 --> 00:00:08.467
-(ALARM BUZZES)
-(KISSES)

00:00:08.547 --> 00:00:10.027
-Yuck!
-(GRUNTS)

00:00:10.547 --> 00:00:13.947
-Mom! What are you doing?
-Your grubby paw was in my bed!

00:00:14.027 --> 00:00:15.347
(STAMMERS)
Were you kissing my hand?

00:00:15.667 --> 00:00:16.667
(LAUGHS NERVOUSLY)

00:00:16.747 --> 00:00:18.267
No. And what about you
with all your shedding?

00:00:18.387 --> 00:00:19.827
-I don't shed.
-Really.

00:00:20.827 --> 00:00:21.827
Uh...

00:00:22.027 --> 00:00:23.467
-Excuse me.
-I just want to get my stuff.

00:00:23.547 --> 00:00:24.587
-Would you just...
-Oh, hey. Come on!

00:00:24.667 --> 00:00:26.027
-...let me get my stuff!
-(GRUNTS)

00:00:26.307 --> 00:00:27.427
(MIKE YELPS)

00:00:27.507 --> 00:00:29.307
-(BOTH GROANING)
-(CAMERA CLICKS)

00:00:29.547 --> 00:00:31.027
First morning in the house.

00:00:31.147 --> 00:00:32.827
That's going in the album!

00:00:32.907 --> 00:00:35.787
-Guys! We got a letter!
-A letter?

00:00:35.867 --> 00:00:37.347
TERRI: We never get mail.

00:00:37.427 --> 00:00:39.747
-Oh! Sorry. It's stuck.
-Would you... Give me that!

00:00:40.027 --> 00:00:41.587
Tentacles. (CHUCKLES) They're sticky.

00:00:42.227 --> 00:00:44.387
(GASPS) It's the first event
of the Scare Games.

00:00:44.627 --> 00:00:45.747
(ALL GASPING)

00:00:45.827 --> 00:00:48.067
"A child's room is where you scare,

00:00:48.147 --> 00:00:50.707
"but avoid the toxicity lurking there."

00:00:50.787 --> 00:00:52.067
Wait a minute.
Where do they want us to meet?

00:00:56.307 --> 00:01:00.507
Of all the sewers on campus,
this one has always been my favorite.

00:01:00.587 --> 00:01:01.987
Art, you've been here before?

00:01:02.067 --> 00:01:05.107
I have a life outside of the house,
you know.

00:01:05.187 --> 00:01:06.587
(CROWD CHEERING)

00:01:06.667 --> 00:01:09.907
Welcome to your worst nightmare,

00:01:09.987 --> 00:01:11.507
the Scare Games!

00:01:11.947 --> 00:01:13.587
(CHEERING CONTINUES)

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:16.147
CROWD: (CHANTING)
Scare Games! Scare Games!

00:01:20.347 --> 00:01:23.027
(CHUCKLES) Yes! Yes, I love it!

00:01:23.427 --> 00:01:24.947
I love this energy!

00:01:25.747 --> 00:01:27.467
Okay. Okay, everybody.

00:01:27.547 --> 00:01:30.107
FEMALE ANNOUNCER: Let's hear it
for the frats and sororities

00:01:30.467 --> 00:01:32.507
competing in this year's games...

00:01:32.627 --> 00:01:35.507
-Jaws Theta Chi!
-(ALL CHEER)

00:01:35.867 --> 00:01:37.667
MALE ANNOUNCER: Python Nu Kappa!

00:01:37.987 --> 00:01:39.107
Slugma Slugma Kappa!

00:01:39.307 --> 00:01:40.307
(ALL GRUNT)

00:01:40.387 --> 00:01:42.547
MALE ANNOUNCER:
Roar Omega Roar!

00:01:42.627 --> 00:01:43.667
(ALL ROARING)

00:01:43.907 --> 00:01:45.347
FEMALE ANNOUNCER: Eta Hiss Hiss!

00:01:45.427 --> 00:01:46.787
(HISSES)

00:01:46.947 --> 00:01:50.267
And finally, Oozma Kappa.

00:01:50.667 --> 00:01:51.947
(SILENCE)

00:01:52.707 --> 00:01:55.147
Yay! Whoo-hoo!

00:01:55.627 --> 00:01:56.947
Hi, Mom!

00:01:57.147 --> 00:01:58.707
-Smile!
-(CAMERA CLICKS)

00:01:59.907 --> 00:02:01.307
(GROANS)

00:02:01.387 --> 00:02:02.587
Let's begin the first competition,

00:02:02.667 --> 00:02:05.147
-the Toxicity Challenge!
-(ALL CHEERING)

00:02:05.227 --> 00:02:07.987
Human children are toxic!

00:02:08.907 --> 00:02:12.307
And anything they touch is toxic.

00:02:12.387 --> 00:02:14.547
MALE ANNOUNCER:
We don't have any human toys,

00:02:14.827 --> 00:02:17.227
but thanks to MU's biology department,

00:02:17.307 --> 00:02:19.147
we found a close second,

00:02:20.627 --> 00:02:23.227
-the stinging glow urchin!
-(ALL GASP)

00:02:23.667 --> 00:02:24.667
(ALL MURMURING)

00:02:24.947 --> 00:02:25.947
Trust me when I say,

00:02:26.027 --> 00:02:27.947
you are not gonna
want to touch this bad boy!

00:02:28.147 --> 00:02:29.307
I want to touch it.

00:02:29.667 --> 00:02:32.667
And you certainly don't want
to touch any of its friends.

00:02:33.627 --> 00:02:35.027
(ALL GASP)

00:02:35.987 --> 00:02:37.147
Yeah, I want to touch them.

00:02:37.467 --> 00:02:39.147
This is the starting line.

00:02:39.227 --> 00:02:42.507
The light at the end of the tunnel
is the finish line.

00:02:42.587 --> 00:02:46.667
And whoever comes in last
is eliminated from the games.

00:02:47.427 --> 00:02:49.147
-Mike...
-(GASPS) What is it?

00:02:49.387 --> 00:02:50.467
Does that mean if we lose, we're out?

00:02:50.707 --> 00:02:52.067
-Don't worry, Smoothie.
-Squishy!

00:02:52.147 --> 00:02:53.667
Squishy. We're not going to lose,

00:02:53.747 --> 00:02:57.427
because we have everything
we need to win right here.

00:02:58.187 --> 00:02:59.187
Heart.

00:02:59.427 --> 00:03:01.187
No! Me. I'm going to win the race for us.

00:03:01.267 --> 00:03:02.787
SULLEY: All right, all right.
That's very cute,

00:03:02.867 --> 00:03:04.947
but move, move, move.
I'm going to win this.

00:03:05.027 --> 00:03:07.187
It's an obstacle course.
What are you going to do? Roar at it?

00:03:07.547 --> 00:03:09.387
I can get through
faster than you, little guy.

00:03:10.867 --> 00:03:13.187
Take your place at the starting line!

00:03:13.707 --> 00:03:15.507
This is all about teamwork.

00:03:16.027 --> 00:03:18.067
Everybody, stick together.

00:03:18.867 --> 00:03:21.227
I'm going to beat you
over that finish line.

00:03:21.307 --> 00:03:22.747
Get ready to eat my dust.

00:03:22.827 --> 00:03:24.547
Hey, guys, should we huddle up?

00:03:25.107 --> 00:03:28.267
Attention, teams. One last thing.

00:03:28.347 --> 00:03:30.147
Scarers work in the dark.

00:03:33.267 --> 00:03:34.827
(CRACKLING)

00:03:36.227 --> 00:03:38.067
-I want to go home!
-On your marks...

00:03:38.787 --> 00:03:40.467
Hey, uh, good luck, ladies.

00:03:40.587 --> 00:03:43.267
Thanks! We're going to
rip you to pieces!

00:03:43.427 --> 00:03:44.467
What?

00:03:44.787 --> 00:03:46.387
-(ALL HISSING)
-(BOTH GASP)

00:03:46.747 --> 00:03:47.747
MALE ANNOUNCER: ...get set...

00:03:49.347 --> 00:03:51.147
-Go!
-(ALL YELLING)

00:03:51.427 --> 00:03:52.587
I'm going to touch them!

00:03:53.667 --> 00:03:54.787
(CHUCKLING)

00:03:55.467 --> 00:03:56.507
(SIGHS)

00:03:57.787 --> 00:03:58.827
(SCREAMING)

00:03:59.427 --> 00:04:00.427
(GASPS)

00:04:02.947 --> 00:04:04.187
(ALL PANTING)

00:04:04.627 --> 00:04:05.747
Ow!

00:04:06.107 --> 00:04:07.187
Come on!

00:04:09.747 --> 00:04:12.227
Uh, guys!
We're falling behind a little! Fellas!

00:04:12.307 --> 00:04:13.347
(SCREAMS)

00:04:13.427 --> 00:04:15.747
Cheese and crackers! (GROANS)

00:04:15.827 --> 00:04:17.147
Son of a moustache!

00:04:17.467 --> 00:04:19.267
Salisbury steak, that hurts!

00:04:19.587 --> 00:04:20.867
Is that as fast as you can go?

00:04:20.947 --> 00:04:22.587
-Just getting started!
-What the...

00:04:23.067 --> 00:04:24.267
(CROWD JEERING)

00:04:26.267 --> 00:04:27.267
Whoa! Ah!

00:04:27.787 --> 00:04:28.867
Oh... Ah!

00:04:28.947 --> 00:04:29.947
(GASPS)

00:04:30.147 --> 00:04:31.387
That's got to hurt!

00:04:32.547 --> 00:04:33.627
(SCREAMS)

00:04:35.627 --> 00:04:37.547
(GROANS) Ow, ow, ow...

00:04:37.627 --> 00:04:38.947
-Ooh!
-Terry!

00:04:39.267 --> 00:04:40.787
Don't worry, we'll be fi...

00:04:40.867 --> 00:04:41.907
(BOTH SCREAM)

00:04:43.027 --> 00:04:44.467
-(BOTH GROAN)
-(YELPING)

00:04:48.347 --> 00:04:49.387
(SCREAMING)

00:04:52.507 --> 00:04:54.067
(BOTH SNIGGER)

00:04:54.827 --> 00:04:56.107
Ha-ha!

00:04:57.267 --> 00:04:58.627
(GASPS) Oh...

00:04:58.907 --> 00:05:00.387
Uh-oh. Yikes!

00:05:00.467 --> 00:05:02.467
Ow! Ow, ow, ow...

00:05:03.267 --> 00:05:04.707
(ROARS)

00:05:05.227 --> 00:05:06.347
(BOTH PANTING)

00:05:06.947 --> 00:05:08.587
MALE ANNOUNCER:
Roar Omega Roar wins!

00:05:12.507 --> 00:05:13.507
(BOTH GRUNT)

00:05:13.947 --> 00:05:15.747
(BOTH ROARING)

00:05:17.827 --> 00:05:18.827
(BOTH GROAN)

00:05:22.347 --> 00:05:24.267
-(BOTH PANTING)
-Take that, Wazowski!

00:05:24.347 --> 00:05:26.427
Are you delirious? I beat you!

00:05:26.507 --> 00:05:27.787
Get your eye checked!

00:05:27.907 --> 00:05:31.427
-Oh, way to blow it, Oozmas!
-Hey! Second place ain't bad.

00:05:31.507 --> 00:05:33.187
MALE ANNOUNCER:
Second place, Jaws Theta Chi!

00:05:33.267 --> 00:05:34.267
What?

00:05:34.547 --> 00:05:37.027
Your whole team
has to cross the finish line.

00:05:37.267 --> 00:05:38.387
MALE ANNOUNCER:
Third place, EEKs!

00:05:38.467 --> 00:05:39.947
-Fourth place, PNKs!
-MIKE: No.

00:05:40.067 --> 00:05:42.347
-Fifth place, HSS!
-No, no, no!

00:05:42.427 --> 00:05:43.667
MALE ANNOUNCER: And in last place,

00:05:44.547 --> 00:05:46.347
Oozma Kappa.

00:05:47.947 --> 00:05:50.027
I can't feel my anything.

00:05:51.227 --> 00:05:54.427
Oh... Shocker! Oozma Kappa
has been eliminated!

00:05:55.187 --> 00:05:56.307
No.

00:05:56.387 --> 00:05:58.107
(BREATHING HEAVILY)

00:05:58.227 --> 00:05:59.307
(GASPS)

00:05:59.987 --> 00:06:02.427
Don't look so surprised, Mr. Wazowski.

00:06:03.107 --> 00:06:05.147
It would have taken a miracle
for you to...

00:06:05.267 --> 00:06:08.467
Attention, everyone.
We have an announcement.

00:06:08.547 --> 00:06:11.467
Jaws Theta Chi has been disqualified.

00:06:11.827 --> 00:06:13.147
(ALL GASP)

00:06:13.227 --> 00:06:17.147
The use of illegal protective gel
is cause for elimination.

00:06:17.227 --> 00:06:18.467
What!

00:06:20.627 --> 00:06:21.667
(GROANS)

00:06:21.747 --> 00:06:24.547
Which means Oozma Kappa
is back in the games!

00:06:24.987 --> 00:06:26.547
It's a miracle!

00:06:27.507 --> 00:06:30.907
Your luck will run out, eventually.

